<section class="hero"><div class="container">
<span class="eyebrow">About the DSG Community</span>
<h1>A collective voice for Data Stewardship in Germany</h1>
<p>We connect expertise, advance the profession, and work to strengthen the strategic role of data stewardship in research.</p>
</div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container">
<span class="eyebrow">Our vision</span><h2>A recognised force for change</h2>
<p>We envision a cohesive, empowered, and recognised data stewardship community that helps shape trustworthy, transparent, reproducible, and sustainable research.</p>
<p>Data stewards should be recognised not only as providers of operational support, but also as strategic contributors to research governance, institutional development, and Open Science.</p>
<h2>Our mission</h2><h3>Connecting expertise. Advancing the profession. Influencing change.</h3>
<p>DSG brings together data stewards and related professionals to exchange knowledge, strengthen professional identity, advocate for sustainable career paths, and make their collective expertise heard in institutional and national discussions.</p>
</div></section>
<section class="section section-soft"><div class="container">
<span class="eyebrow">Our shared foundation</span><h2>Our Manifesto</h2>
<p>The <em>Manifesto of the Data Stewardship in Germany Community – A Strategic Vision for the Future of Research Data Stewardship</em> sets out our collective ambitions and priorities for the profession.</p>
<p>Community documents and publications are available through our <a href="/resources/">Resources page</a> and the <a href="https://zenodo.org/communities/dsgg/records">DSgG Zenodo Community</a>.</p>
</div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container">
<h2>Our Strategic Priorities</h2>
<div class="card-grid">
<article class="card"><h3>Strategic role</h3><p>Establish data stewardship as a cross-cutting contributor to institutional research strategies, policies, and governance.</p></article>
<article class="card"><h3>Professionalisation and careers</h3><p>Promote recognised professional profiles, skills development, and sustainable career pathways.</p></article>
<article class="card"><h3>Collaboration and learning</h3><p>Foster peer exchange, knowledge sharing, and collective responses to common challenges.</p></article>
<article class="card"><h3>Networking and advocacy</h3><p>Build alliances and represent the perspectives of data stewards in relevant national and international discussions.</p></article>
</div></div></section>
<section class="section section-soft"><div class="container">
<h2>Our Community and Governance</h2>
<p>DSG is shaped by the voluntary engagement of community members. A steering group supports coordination and direction, while flexible working groups enable members to collaborate on shared priorities. Partnerships and stakeholder relationships connect our community with the wider research landscape.</p>
<p>Our approach values inclusivity, transparency, accountability, and participation. Working groups and initiatives can evolve as community needs change.</p>
<a href="/community/">Explore our community →</a>
</div></section>
